#
# AArch64 does not have x86-style port I/O instructions (in/out). All device
# access is memory-mapped. This module provides API-compatible stubs that map
# port addresses to MMIO operations via a base address. On real hardware, the
# platform firmware provides the ECAM (Enhanced Configuration Access Mechanism)
# base address for PCI configuration space access.
#
